 ## Background
-The Spawn Gate was introduced in the BlitzGS paper [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the issue of transient peak population sizes during 3D Gaussian Splatting training, which dictate per-GPU memory limits. The method leverages the observation that survival to the final model is predictable from spawn-time features, particularly in the late densification window where survival rates drop sharply [S1, unofficial].
